        "original_id": "a31a355f-b66b-50ea-8496-ae70572d48fa",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jan Egil Storholt, Sten Stensen, Amund Sjøbrend, Kay Stenshjemmet, Leif Jenssen\n- Places: Trondheim, Norway\n- Concepts: speed skating, weightlifting, the \"four S-es\"\n\nFacts:\n- Leif Jenssen was born on March 19, 1948 and is a former Norwegian weightlifter.\n- Jan Egil Storholt was born on February 13, 1949 and is a former Norwegian speed skater.\n- Jan Egil Storholt was born in Trondheim, Norway.\n- In the 1970s and early 1980s, Sten Stensen, Amund Sjøbrend, Kay Stenshjemmet, and Jan Egil Storholt were known as the legendary Norwegian \"four S-es\" among top skaters.\n- In 2013, Trondheim was Norway's third largest city, with 169,972 inhabitants within the city borders.",
